{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1470660-v5-fate-of-sabbat-luminaries","id":1470660,"title":"[V5] Fate of Sabbat luminaries","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-16T15:01:48-08:00","id":1470660,"title":"[V5] Fate of Sabbat luminaries","content":"Creative thread: where do you think are now the luminaries of Revised Sabbat, considering the decentralized nature of V5's Sword of Caine? <br /> <br /> What do we know:<br /> <br /> Lucita: allegedly survived as Archbishop of Madrid; what has happened of her bid to regency? <br /> <br /> Vykos: has given birth to the Dracon, allegedly in the Middle East; why is he named Martyr, now? <br /> <br /> Cicatriz: still in Tijuana<br /> <br /> Joseph Suthpen: moved to Belgrade<br /> <br /> Jalan Ajaav: allegedly killed by the Second Inquisition<br /> <br /> Talley: here and there, running for his unlife<br /> <br /> Vasantasena: has joined the Anarchs<br /> <br /> <br /> Some of my personal Canon:<br /> <br /> Marconius: officially joined the Camarilla, and one of the main leaders of the Circulatory System<br /> <br /> Kyle Strathcona: his plan to get the Sabbat together in defence of Montreal has backfired horribly; has joined the Anarchs or was burned by SI<br /> <br /> Polonia: his bid to Regency was close to succeed, but in the end he was killed by the SI, averted by his constant bragging about 09/11. In the eyes of the Gehenna Crusaders, a martyr and an example. <br /> <br /> Charles Delmare: as Polonia fell, he tried to use his mantle to fortify its military coup. Evidence of Galbraith's death was used as an excuse for extensive purges: as soon as he weakened the Sabbat enough, True Black Hand agents orchestrated his demise during the Drowned rise. <br /> <br /> Venere Carboni: purged by Delmare for alleged infernalism, as soon as he got hold of enough of Mexico City. <br /> <br /> Szecheny Zolan: tried to use her massive array of fleshcrafted monsters to exterminate the Consistory and take power. What of her afterwards? <br /> <br /> Alfred Benezri and Ezekiel: presumably killed each other in the fires of Montreal's fall. <br /> <br /> Bishop Natalio: as the dust settled on the Consistory, he denounced the hipocrisy of Sabbat leaders, declared the end of Regency and broadcasted a global call to Crusade. Now busy fighting in the Middle East, perhaps dead. <br /> <br /> Dominique Touraine: joined the Anarchs along with Vasantasena, as she saw the Sect torn asunder by Civil War","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-16T15:04:02-08:00","id":1470661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Lucita: allegedly survived as Archbishop of Madrid; what has happened of her bid to regency? </div> </div> </div>They've repeated in CBN and TBH that Talley apparently killed Lucita and more or less said the Lucita in Madrid is an imposter.<br /> <br /> So they've clearly got something planned there.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Vykos: has given birth to the Dracon, allegedly in the Middle East; why is he named Martyr, now? </div> </div> </div>Isn't the Angel of Caine, Vykos?","signature":"<hr class=\"