12:44-08:00","id":1470686,"title":"","content":"Where is Vykos called the Martyr?<br /> <br /> Where in TBH does it say Tally killed Lucita?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-16T20:27:57-08:00","id":1470687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1470660-v5-fate-of-sabbat-luminaries?p=1470686#post1470686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where is Vykos called the Martyr?</div> </div> </div> </div>Page 74.<br /> <br /> <i>For example, Archbishop Lucita of Madrid is Lasombra antitribu and Sascha Vykos, the martyr of Caine, is Tzimisce antitribu.</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where in TBH does it say Tally killed Lucita? </div> </div> </div>Page 81<br /> <br /> <i>Complicating matters, certain noteworthy Kindred claim that Lucita has met the final death \u2013 but if that\u2019s true, who are her packmates following?</i><br /> <br /> It was CBN where Talley was said to have killed Lucita.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>