=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1470660-v5-fate-of-sabbat-luminaries?p=1470683#post1470683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I love the Sabbat but I love them because they're a trashfire. If you have the Sabbat win, you lose what's appealing about them.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mLyOj_QD4a4\" data-code=\"mLyOj_QD4a4\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/mLyOj_QD4a4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Hard disagree, what's appealing about them is inhumanity, bizarre philosophy, fanaticism and the schismatic politics. Do agree that no one should win the jyhad tho, cam vs sabbat is the core conflict imho.<br /> <br /> As to why Vykos is the Marty.. Micheal is stirring, and rebuilding his trinity..so may have something to do with it, it could also to do with the aftermath of The Dracons rise","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-17T14:13:54-08:00","id":1470742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1470660-v5-fate-of-sabbat-luminaries?p=1470727#post1470727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hard disagree, what's appealing about them is inhumanity, bizarre philosophy, fanaticism and the schismatic politics. Do agree that no one should win the jyhad tho, cam vs sabbat is the core conflict imho.<br /> <br /> As to why Vykos is the Marty.. Micheal is stirring, and rebuilding his trinity..so may have something to do with it, it could also to do with the aftermath of The Dracons rise</div> </div> </div> </div>Hard disagree on both.<br /> <br /> 1. Part of what makes the Sabbat appealing to me is the fact that they're trying very hard to become Nieztschean supermen and post-human philosopher kings. It's INTERESTING, though, because only like 10% of people in the Sabbat are even capanle of understanding the question. It's a full-on Plato's the Cave situation for me. What makes it cool is the fact that if you explained the Paths to a typical recruit for 150 years, he STILL WOULDN'T GET IT. So you have these genius noble demons and these pathetic assholes and the tension between them makes Sabbat games really entertaining. Because simply put: the majority of vampires are not suitable for immortality let alone Sabbat immortality.<br /> <br /> Which isn't saying the inhumanity and aliennes is bad. It's just that it should be rare because it's cool.<br /> <br /> 2. I really hate this because I loved BJD having Vykos free himself from the Dracon and finally end his association with Michael as well as the insanity of the Dream. It seems bioth he and Lucita essentially became their slave masters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-17T16:58:05-08:00","id":1470753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1470660-v5-fate-of-sabbat-luminaries?p=1470742#post1470742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. I really hate this because I loved BJD having Vykos free himself from the Dracon and finally end his association with Michael as well as the insanity of the Dream. It seems bioth he and Lucita essentially became their slave masters.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder if the story about Vykos (being impregnated by the Eldest with the Dracon) got out. And so people view Vykos and her suffering, as a kind of martyrdom.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-17T19:15:47-08:00","id":1470756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1470660-v5-fate-of-sabbat-luminaries?p=1470742#post1470742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hard disagree on both.<br /> <br /> 1. Part of what makes the Sabbat appealing to me is the fact that they're trying very hard to become Nieztschean supermen and post-human philosopher kings. It's INTERESTING, though, because only like 10% of people in the Sabbat are even capanle of understanding the question. It's a full-on Plato's the Cave situation for me. What makes it cool is the fact that if you explained the Paths to a typical recruit for 150 years, he STILL WOULDN'T GET IT. So you have these genius noble demons and these pathetic assholes and the tension between them makes Sabbat games really entertaining. Because simply put: the majority of vampires are not suitable for immortality let alone Sabbat immortality.<br /> <br /> Which isn't saying the inhumanity and aliennes is bad. It's just that it should be rare because it's cool.<br /> <br /> 2. I really hate this because I loved BJD having Vykos free himself from the Dracon and finally end his association with Michael as well as the insanity of the Dream. It seems bioth he and Lucita essentially became their slave masters.</div> </div> </div> </div>I totally agree with your analysis of the Sabbat and the vampiric condition in point 1. That\u2019s exactly how I see them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-17T20:00:54-08:00"